        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Two new Warhammer x DK books to get excited about in 2025]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/susphkjl/two-new-warhammer-x-dk-books-to-get-excited-about-in-2025</link>
            <guid>susphkjl</guid>
            <pubDate>Fri, 28 Feb 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Take a sneak peek at two must-have forthcoming Warhammer x DK books. Coming in October, Warhammer 40,000 Character Encyclopedia features profiles of more than 120 characters from the 41st Millennium, from legendary Primarchs, both loyalist and traitor, to enigmatic Phoenix Lords and brutal Warbosses. And November sees the release of The Art of Warhammer Video Games – a stunning volume showcasing classic games like the Dawn of War series alongside more recent smash hits like Space Marine 2.]]></description>
